DTEND:20260625T123000
UID:0eb8f437c53e3fcaf334abb2e2919bd3@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:LGBT YouthLine is excited to announce that we are once again p
 artnering with the City of Toronto and the Toronto Kiki Ballroom Alliance 
 on a day-long gathering for 2-Spirit\, trans\, and non-binary youth ✨ TR
 ANScendTO will be held in downtown Toronto on Thursday\, June 25th\, 2026.
  It will include skill-building workshops\, social opportunities\, a commu
 nity resources fair\, and a Kiki Ball! 💖 This event runs from 12:30-8:3
 0 PM\, doors open at 12:00 PM. We invite all 2-Spirit\, trans\, and non-bi
 nary youth to attend by filling out the registration form at the link in o
 ur bio on instagram💕 If you’re a service provider or educator\, pleas
 e share this post with your service users\, clients\, students\, and other
  groups that support 2SLGBTQ+ youth in Toronto\, Scarborough\, Etobicoke\,
  and North York. Your work team can also apply to table at the community r
 esources fair at the link in our bio. ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/transcendto
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
