BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Forbidden Fruit Kinky Market Cabaret- Punky Pride Edition
DTSTART:20260625T190000
DTEND:20260625T190000
UID:2b0dcb578ab97b63e5b71b7c6f85bd2a@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Garden- Join the Cabaret! Come pick the Forbidd
 en Fruit of knowledge at Torontos’ Queerest Kinkiest Market and Performa
 nce Packed Play Party A place for queer joys and fun toys! We&#x27\;re bac
 k at our beloved home Birdhaus! (Toronto’s safest\, sex-positive\, queer
  haven\, where aesthetic vibes are high and judgment is low) on the 25th o
 f June for our 🌈🌈🌈 Punky Pride Edition🌈🌈🌈 This is YOUR i
 nvitation to indulge in shopping for wares that are soaked in artistic fre
 edom joy\, playful exploration. Be surrounded in a room of your local dege
 nerates who are just as deviant as you are and who care about the quality 
 of their NSFW goods! 😉 Instead of buying your erotic art\, toys\, fetis
 h wear off the internet\, come connect and actually talk to the artist mak
 ing your pieces. They are people who care just as much about the product y
 ou&#x27\;re buying as you do. Come for the goods. Stay for the vibes. We m
 ust protect our artistans and these spaces. So lets do it in style! Shop l
 eather\, to toys to art! We are also hosting an amazing line up of perform
 ers who range from the sensual to the sadistic to the downright silly! And
  some phenomenal Djs curated by our resident DJ @RiskyMedicine Visit our b
 ody painting station hosted by the fabulous @LilithArtistry Everyone is we
 lcome – but leave the kink-shaming and misconduct at the door\, because 
 that won’t fly here. This is a safe\, inclusive event\, focused on celeb
 rating all things queer\, kinky\, and oh-so-exploratory. The rules? Play n
 ice\, but PLAY. This is a Kink Forward Play Party. No sex or penetration o
 n the premises (this is not that kind of show)\, but everything else goes
 —just follow the *dungeon rules*. We will also have some sweet surprises
  in our toy library. Or take a chance to try out that new toy you just got
  upstairs. Playtime downstairs takes a break during scheduled performances
 \, but trust us\, it’s worth it. When? - 7 PM to 12 AM - Cocktail Bar - 
 $25 Entry - $15 for Financial Assistance (will not be available at the doo
 r\, so please buy online beforehand if you need FA) We&#x27\;re producing 
 this event FOR and BY the queer kink community because let’s face it\, w
 e needed a space ‍
LOCATION:Birdhaus\, 1233 Queen Street West Rear ( the big pink building!)
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/forbidden-fruit-kinky-market-cabaret--punk
 y-pride-edition
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
