 3 min) With a Live Score by Johnny Spence Join us at United Unlimited\, To
 ronto’s new microcinema\, for an exclusive screening of PASSING STRANGER
 S. Written and directed by one of the true unsung masters of American cine
 ma\, Arthur J. Bressan Jr\, with a live score by the incomparable Johnny S
 pence. More than a p*rno\, more than a romance\, Passing Strangers delicat
 ely tells the story of a twink with a huge 🍆who meets an older man afte
 r answering a personal ad. From butt sex to to his first pride march\, he 
 rapidly becomes sexually\, romantically and politically involved in 70s ga
 y San Francisco. With Johnny’s live piano score\, this is the XXX screen
 ing you never knew you needed. Thursday\, June 25th\, 2026 At United Unlim
 ited DM for address (near Bloor and Lansdowne) Doors at 7:30 pm\, show at 
 8:00 pm PWYC 18+ ‍
