UID:ea4b0e4a69bbf79c5ce6e0397f294ce0@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:CHOOSE YOUR DJ CHARACTER FOR GAYMER MODE: BI EDITION Introduci
 ng our skilled\, sexy\, talented line up of DJ’s ********************* @
 madame.myles MS.MYLES is a Toronto-based Jamaican Trans-Female DJ\, Curato
 r and Founder\, conceived by Toronto’s downtown raves and bashments. Her
  barrier-breaking experience inspires provoking\, timeless &amp\; genre-be
 nding sets and events. Discover your head\, hips &amp\; feet moving on the
 ir own with a global journey of dance music. GENRES: CLUB\, BAILE FUNK\, B
 UBBLING\, JUKE &amp\; FOOTWORK\, BASS\, BREAKS\, HOUSE\, VOGUE\, TECHNO\, 
 and MORE. ********************* @trinixdaddy DJ TRINIDADDY (they/he) is an
  Indo-Trinidadian DJ born &amp\; based in the Greater Tkaronto region. As 
 a queer &amp\; non-binary person in the DJ community since 2018\, they aim
  to create more space for (QT)BIPOC in party &amp\; gathering spaces\, and
  hope to inspire &amp\; build community through their sound &amp\; practic
 e. They are organizer &amp\; founder of Wine Dung!\, a queer fete centerin
 g queer Caribbean people &amp\; sounds based in Tkaronto. GENRES: soca\, b
 ouyon\, chutney\, dancehall\, 90s/2000s hits to vogue beats\, ghetto tech\
 , house\, UKG/funky\, amapiano\, afrobeats\, baile funk ******************
 *** @hellokittynaz DJ NAZTY (she/they) is a downtown Toronto rat\, DJ and 
 stage manager. They drop hot cues for the stage and hotter cues for the da
 nce floor… Being a true Toronto rat means that NAZTY was raised by FLOW 
 93.5 and her mom’s friends mixes. Her sounds will take you through their
  experience and appreciation for their city. Her goal is to make her frien
 ds dance\, laugh and singalong so expect to move\, groove and maybe shake 
 an ass cheek or two? ********************* @djmayzei DJ Mayzei is a genre-
 blending tastemaker spinning global club sounds with infectious energy. Fr
 om the deep grooves of Amapiano and the bounce of Afrobeats to the raw rhy
 thms of Baile Funk and the punch of Jersey Club\, Mayzei seamlessly fuses 
 familiar club classics with underground heat. He’s known for creating hi
 gh-energy sets that take dancefloors on a journey across continents. ‍
LOCATION:Midnight Arcade\, 158 Augusta Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/gaymer-mode-choose-your-dj-character
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
