DTEND:20260627T220000
UID:b5097ebbf54e5418b55127714066aea2@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Don&#x27\;t think. Just bite. Details coming soon. About New H
 o Queen New Ho Queen is a nightlife collective of Trans and Queer Asian ar
 tists working across music\, performance\, design\, fashion\, and film. Si
 nce 2018\, they’ve been creating vibrant\, safer party spaces for people
  to connect\, celebrate\, and center Queer Asian joy. Rooted in community\
 , their work moves between nightlife and cultural programming. They’ve h
 osted thousands of attendees and commissioned hundreds of QTBIPOC artists\
 , building a space where Asian artists are seen at their best. New Ho Quee
 n is currently a Party-in-Residence at Buddies in Bad Times Theatre (2024 
 – 2026)\, and has been featured in W Magazine. Queer Pride 2026 June 5 
 – 28\, 2026 WE’RE BACK DIVAS &lt\;3 It’s Queer Pride 2026 and Buddie
 s and Buddies Nightlife are teaming up to make HERstory with our messiest\
 , most maximalist Pride yet. We’ve got a full month line-up of extremely
  queer parties\, raves\, cabarets\, concerts\, and comedy. No matter what 
 flavour you bring\, there’s room for you in our alphabet soup \;) Join u
 s on the biggest dance floor in the village for the best of queer culture 
 in Toronto and beyond. Thank you to our Government Partners\, Canadian Her
 itage and Experience Ontario\, our Platinum Sponsor\, National Bank\, and 
 our Gold Sponsor\, Freddie\, for making the 2026 Queer Pride Festival poss
 ible! ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/new-ho-queen-fruit
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
