BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NO STRANGERS VOL.3
DTSTART:20260627T233000
DTEND:20260627T233000
UID:2afe76da4a33c2f81e01ac26f21384d6@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:No Strangers (AP) is a late-night gathering for those still ou
 tside when the night isn’t done. Whether you&#x27\;re coming from anothe
 r event or stepping out just for this\, the doors stay open for a crowd th
 at already understands the energy. Expect DJs guiding the room through hip
 -hop\, reggae\, R&amp\;B\, amapiano\, and Afro-inspired sounds—music tha
 t moves comfortably between deep\, familiar\, and celebratory. The vibe is
  unforced\, the room feels connected\, and the night unfolds at its own pa
 ce. As Toronto comes alive during Pride Month\, we&#x27\;re proud to celeb
 rate the diversity\, freedom\, and self-expression that make this city spe
 cial. No Strangers was built on the belief that everyone deserves a space 
 where they can show up as themselves\, feel welcomed\, and connect through
  music\, culture\, and community. Pride is a reminder of the power of visi
 bility\, inclusion\, and chosen family—values that continue to shape the
  spirit of this event. This isn’t about big moments or introductions. It
 ’s about arriving late\, settling in\, and sharing the space with people
  who feel like they belong. No strangers. ‍
LOCATION:Daniels Spectrum\, 585 Dundas Street East
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/no-strangers-vol-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
