UID:6df1f0078a2b0279c8c428a6fd94a74c@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:STACHE 7th Edition\, For Moustache Bearers &amp\; Enthusiasts 
 Dear Diary\, It’s July 4\, 3:42AM. I still taste the salt on my lips. Pr
 ide weekend came and went\, but the real heat didn’t peak until last nig
 ht at the Eagle. It’s the scratch of a moustache against the neck that s
 tays with you. The way shadows fall over your lips just before the lights 
 cut to black. The dance floor was thick with it…bodies slick\, as our ch
 ests vibrating to the heavy bass. We didn’t talk much. We didn’t need 
 to. Clearly I was looking in the right dark corners. See you at STACHE. Fr
 iday\, July 03\, 2026 | Black Eagle Toronto @eagletoronto $10 before 10PM\
 , $15 after. Hosted by David Kraft Music by Sandy Watts &amp\; Discoraphy 
 Gogo Dancers: Chris Raynor &amp\; TBA Disco\, House\, Hi-NRG\, Synthpop\, 
 Rock n’ Roll\, Italo-Disco\, and Electronic music all night long. Mousta
 ches out\, shirts optional. ‍
LOCATION:The Black Eagle\, 457 Church Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/stache-9
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
