 ses\, breezy separates\, lace\, or romantic boho\, with optional body pain
 ting at the event. A ceremonial flower crown making station\, dances benea
 th the lights\, a maypole-themed dance circle\, and a plounge draped in ga
 rlands. This is a play party exclusively for queer women\, trans\, non-bin
 ary\, and two-spirit folx. You do not have to identify as “sapphic” if
  it does not fit\, the only limitation on attendance is that cis men are n
 ot permitted in the space. CIS MEN ARE NOT PERMITTED TO ATTEND THIS EVENT.
